  "notes": [
    "One Drift City cast member on the helmet comms feed, speaking a recorded line: `# APP: talkinghead line=mags-3 [mood=wry]`. A rigged Gaussian-splat head (LAM, synthetic faces only), mouth moved by the clip. It plays without a tap in its frame, so it needs autoplay; it hands control back when the line ends (drift-city/feed/index.html)."
  ]
